# An allowlist: nothing is sent to the image build unless it's let in below.
#
# So secrets (.env), node_modules built for the Mac (the wrong bcrypt for
# Linux) and any local or editor files stay out by default, and a new file
# only reaches the image when someone adds it here on purpose.

*

!package.json
!bun.lock
!tsconfig.json
!src
!scripts
!db

# Never an env file, not even one inside the folders let in above.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Finder litter inside the folders let in above.
**/.DS_Store
